<title>NIGERIA: SOCCER-SHOOTING STARS BEAT ZAMALEK 2-1 IN AFRICAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SHOOTING STARS BEAT ZAMALEK 2-1 IN AFRICAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>IBADAN, Nigeria 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of African Champions' Cup final first leg played on Saturday.</p>
<p>Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 2 Zamalek (Egypt) 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Shooting Stars - Patrick Pascal (34), Ajibade Babalade (63)</p>
<p>Zamalek - Mustapha Tariq (88)</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
</text>
